msgid "The BA's result from testing the increment's behaviour. `no` returns to implementation; `yes` asks whether the MVP is ready for stakeholders."
msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-deliver.bpmn:122
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The stakeholder's result from testing the MVP in their own context. `findings` go to the BA to translate into direction for the agent; `accepted` goes on to the post-MVP theme and UI review."
msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-deliver.bpmn:131
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "THERE IS NO THEME REVIEW HERE, and that is a rule rather than an omission: theme review happens at INGESTION ONLY, called from `ingest-theme.bpmn`, where the graphical assets arrive and are determined, not here, where they have already been built into what shipped."
msgstr ""

